            "value" : "Always in Capture One"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Immer in Capture One: wirkt auch, wenn ein anderes Programm vorne ist. Im aktiven Programm: Programme mit eigenem Profil (Tab „Tasten\") bekommen ihre Tastenkürzel, alle anderen die Capture-One-Belegung." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Always in Capture One: works even when another app is in front. In the active app: apps with their own profile (Buttons tab) get their keyboard shortcuts, all others the Capture One mapping."
